iors have been looking for ways to armor their mounts almost as long as they've been armoring themselves. It doesn't take a genius to figure out that an unarmored horse might be an easier target than the heavily plated knight who's riding it. Therefore, c
haracters who plan on riding their horses into battle should try to acquire barding.
